<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Usage Collection The Resource Usage Collection Aggregate Function collects data from traffic counters and resource usage records which enables gathering of information from equipment and probes.
Examples: 
          - Traffic data (such as switch load counters),
          - Usage data (such as Radius ticket).</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

