<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Resource Usage Errors Management Resource Usage Errors Management Aggregate Function manages usage records which have been identified as being non-processable due to edit, guide, routing, etc. Failures
It is in charge of categorizing, analysing root cause, correcting and new submission of Resource Usage failures.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

