<rdf:label rdf:datatype = "http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#langString">Regulatory Rules Management Regulatory Rules Management Aggregate Function groups functions in charge of managing regulatory rules, checking their application by the enterprise and providing reporting of regulatory rules to various legal and regulatory entities.</rdf:label>
</owl:NamedIndividual>

